# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DATA — never committed.
# HMD is free but redistribution is restricted by its user agreement: users
# must register and accept the terms themselves. Re-hosting the files here
# would breach that. Reproducibility is served by data/MANIFEST.sha256
# (checksums + vintage) plus the documented download procedure, NOT by the
# bytes. ~900 MB, would also blow past GitHub's repo size guidance.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Dataset/
data/raw/
data/interim/
data/processed/
*.zip

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LITERATURE — PDFs and extracted full text are publisher-copyrighted.
# Committing them is redistribution. The curated notes (INDEX.md, MISSING.md,
# GAP-ANALYSIS.md) are our own writing and ARE tracked.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
literature/pdf/
literature/pdf-other-datasets/
literature/txt/
*.pdf

# ── Backups / scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.ORIGINAL.*
*.bak
~$*.docx
~$*.xlsx

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.uv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# ── R ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj

